E
"near-vertical vertical hill"
"Tufts of grass struggle to grow from the hillside, which is oddly made.  The
hill looks as though it has been cut, as if with a knife, but holds strong
with the help of the rocky soil.
"
E
"ladder poles"
"The ladder is embedded in the ground and seems to be tied by something at the
top, but the wooden poles it is made of don't look quite strong enough to hold
a large amount of weight.  Obviously it is intended for use by the little folk.
"
E
"oval stones path"
"The stones have been swept clean recently, though their dull grey coloring
hardly shows it.  They are smooth and rounded, perfectly comfortable to be
walked on by bare feet.
"
E
"door north"
"This door was made from a horizontal slice of a tree trunk, the rings plainly
visible.  It has s small half-moon window and the doorknob is a small brass
fixture inserted into a carved out knot.
"
E
"wildflowers grass tufts ground"
"The ground is rocky, making grass and flowers struggle to grow in the tiny
space they can claim.
"
